<title>TURKEY: Turkey 182-d T-bill avg yield rises to 128.92 pct.</title>
<headline>Turkey 182-d T-bill avg yield rises to 128.92 pct.</headline>
<dateline>ISTANBUL 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The 182-day T-bill auction of the Turkish treasury on Tuesday produced the following results.</p>
<p>	Maturity		    :March 12, 1997</p>
<p>	Amount			:106.9 trln lira</p>
<p>	Coupon			: -</p>
<p>	Minimum yield	     :124.47</p>
<p>	Maximum yield	     :129.40</p>
<p>	Average yield	     :128.92</p>
<p>	Bid amount/cover	  :191.2 trln</p>
<p>	Lowest accepted price   :66,017 lira</p>
<p>Pct allocated at lowest price : NA</p>
<p>	Payment date		:September 11, 1996</p>
<p>--Istanbul newsroom +90-212-275 08 75</p>
